### Country and region reference data

`prisma/countries/*.json` and `prisma/regions/*.json` were compiled for this
project by its author, Deividas Valaitis, and are covered by the project's
AGPL-3.0-only license along with the rest of the source.

The data they carry is factual reference information derived from the ISO 3166
standard: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2/alpha-3/numeric country codes with their names,
capitals, currencies and languages, and ISO 3166-2 subdivision codes and names.
Country codes and their assigned names are factual identifiers and are not
themselves the subject of copyright; the selection and arrangement published
here is the project's own. No ISO database file or ISO-published text is
redistributed.

### Fonts

The application loads the Inter typeface at build time via `next/font`. Inter is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. No font binaries are committed to
this repository.

### Member data

This repository deliberately contains **no** real member data. Development and
tests use synthetic records generated by `scripts/seed/seed-demo-users.js` and
the example file `data/examples/member-register.example.csv`.

